            "review_title": "Review at Quan Dau",
            "review_text": "Nguyen Ngoc T\n7 contributions\n0\nBest Bun Cha in Buon Ma Thuot\nApr 2018 • Solo\nGood food at reasonable prices. They serve many dishes from the North like bun cha, bun dau mam tom and cha com. I usually order bun cha when I visit this place. Bun cha here gives the same taste like those I used to have in Saigon though pickled carrots and turnips are a little bit sourer.\nIn the picture is a special serving of bun dau mam tom comprising of grilled pork, boiled pork, cha com, fried tofu, fried spring rolls, rice vermicelli and vegetables. They leave sugar and kumquat on the tables so that you can season the mam tom to your taste. Service is a little bit slow when the place ia crowded.\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
