            "review_text": "jackie T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nCheap and good food!\nAug 2013 • Friends\nWe had dinner here and tried some diffirent food. The food price from $1 - $1.5 listed on the menu. The food here was really good for us. They said the food here come from the North, the bamboo low table and wall decor as The North traditional farm ... Vietnammese traditional food. I love it!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 22, 2013",
